सर्गेऽपि नोपजायन्ते प्रलये न व्यथन्ति च ॥ २ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3832,\"bb\":3374,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/2/b3374/\",\"body_value\":\"idaṁ jñānam upāśritya
